          "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 02 2018 16:06:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Welded seams</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">ComfortGel SE features RF welded seams that utilize electromagnetic bonding to limit fluid ingress and infiltration.</span></p>\n",
